1
00:00:01,309 --> 00:00:03,329
[mele]

2
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:19,705
Ahiahi hou ma ka hale kūʻai kope,

3
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:19,705
Hoʻoheheʻe ka noe mānoanoa i nā hale. [mele]

4
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:26,200
Ke auwana nei au ma nā kaiāulu kahi i waiho ʻia ai nā hoʻomanaʻo

5
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:26,200
hoʻohuli iaʻu i ka pupule.

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:32,095
Ma hea i ka pūnāwai mahana

7
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:33,320
Uhi ka hoʻoilo i ka ʻuhane.

8
00:00:32,095 --> 00:00:36,760
[mele]

9
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:38,645
Kahi i lele ai ke ola e like me ka pua i hala nā lā, nā lā i hala

10
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:39,160
mākou.

11
00:00:38,645 --> 00:00:43,080
[mele]

12
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:45,520
Ua hōʻiliʻili mākou i nā pepa, e poina ana i ke kumu

13
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:45,520
ke ola nei mākou.

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:52,200
A me he mea lā, [mele]

15
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:52,200
aia nō ke kani C i mua.

16
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,560
[mele]

17
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:58,520
Ua hōʻaiʻē wale ʻia ka manawa

18
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:58,520
ʻaʻohe mea e hāʻawi ai.

19
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:04,440
A hāʻule koke mai [mele] ma luna o kuʻu puʻuwai

20
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:08,960
hau anuanu.

21
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:12,200
Aʻo mākou e mahalo i [mele] ke nalowale mākou,

22
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:14,670
ke pio ke kukui o kekahi ma hope o ka puka.

23
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,240
Ke peahi nei mākou ma hope o nā kaʻaahi e haʻalele ana, e hoʻāʻo ana

24
00:01:14,670 --> 00:01:18,320
[mele]

25
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:21,920
e noi i ka wā i hala no kahi pane.

26
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:25,000
Ke aʻo nei mākou e aloha i ka wā anu, [mele]

27
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:26,360
i ka wā he lehu i loko o kou mau poho lima, ʻaʻole ke kila. E PILI ANA,

28
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
inā wale nō wau i ʻike ma mua, [mele]

29
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:31,840
pehea e ʻeha ai kēia mea moakaka i loko o ka ʻuhane

30
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,320
kaumaha.

31
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:37,840
ʻAʻole ʻo ia i ʻōlelo, [mele] ʻaʻole ʻo ia i ʻapo, ʻaʻohe ona manawa.

32
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:41,120
He kumu hoʻoikaika mau loa kēia.

33
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:43,545
Ua mālama au i nā mea a pau no ka wā ma hope, ʻaʻole koʻu puʻuwai no nā poʻe ʻē aʻe

34
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:43,545
ua wehe ʻia. [mele]

35
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,520
Ke hakakā nei mākou me ke aka,

36
00:01:46,111 --> 00:01:50,480
[mele]

37
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:53,316
pau mākou i ka pau ʻana i nā mea liʻiliʻi.

38
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:53,880
ʻAʻole hiki iā ʻoe ke ʻike pehea e hoʻomaha ai ka hau

39
00:01:53,316 --> 00:01:56,960
[mele]

40
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:59,211
ma luna o ko mākou mau poʻohiwi.

41
00:01:56,960 --> 00:02:01,800
Akā, ʻaʻole ka hauʻoli i loko o ka ʻālohilohi o ka puka makani o ka hale kūʻai,

42
00:01:59,211 --> 00:02:05,040
[mele] ʻaʻole i loko o kahi puʻu o nā bila, akā i loko o kahi mālie

43
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:06,880
ka ʻoiaʻiʻo o nā hoahānau, i ko lākou mehana i waena o nā ʻino. Akā,

44
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:09,920
mahalo wale mākou i ka mea [mele] i kēia manawa

45
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:12,600
hiki ʻole ke hoʻi.

46
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:15,760
Ke hoʻomau nei i kaʻu lōʻihi

47
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:20,280
a pinepine [ke mele] he ala ʻole ia,

48
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:23,480
aʻo mākou e mahalo i ka wā e nalowale ai [mele],

49
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:25,880
ke pio ke kukui o kekahi ma hope o ka puka.

50
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:29,520
Ke peahi aku nei mākou ma hope o [mele] i nā kaʻaahi i haʻalele,

51
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:33,160
e hoʻāʻo ana e noi i ka wā i hala no kahi pane.

52
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:35,000
Aʻo mākou e aloha i [mele] ke hoʻomaha iki,

53
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:36,160
i ka wā he lehu i loko o nā poho lima, [mele] a ʻaʻole

54
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,200
kila. E PILI ANA,

55
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:43,040
Inā wale nō wau i ʻike ma mua pehea e uē ai

56
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:45,061
kēia kaumaha akaka i loko o ka ʻuhane.

57
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:45,480
E kāhea aku i ka poʻe ʻelemakule, e ʻapo iā lākou,

58
00:02:45,061 --> 00:02:49,000
[mele]

59
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:49,000
ʻoiai ke kuʻi nei ka pulse.

60
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:54,231
E hala aku nā ʻōhumu, no kēia au i kēia lā

61
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:55,080
Ke pule nei au.

62
00:02:54,231 --> 00:02:58,280
[mele]

63
00:02:55,080 --> 00:03:00,127
No ka mea, he hopena ko nā mele a pau

64
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:01,320
i ka hopena, hoʻokahi.

65
00:03:00,127 --> 00:03:04,680
[mele]

66
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:06,022
Ke noho nei mākou [mele] i ka hoʻomanaʻo o nā hanana koʻikoʻi,

67
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:07,280
noho poina mākou.

68
00:03:06,022 --> 00:03:11,760
[mele]

69
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:13,720
Aʻo mākou e mahalo i ka wā e nalowale ai mākou,

70
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:14,959
ke kani ke mele a kekahi ma hope o ka puka

71
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:17,959
mālamalama.

72
00:03:14,959 --> 00:03:20,959
Ke peahi nei mākou ma hope o nā kaʻaahi e haʻalele ana, e hoʻāʻo ana

73
00:03:17,959 --> 00:03:22,360
e noi i ka wā i hala no kahi pane.

74
00:03:20,959 --> 00:03:25,800
Ke aʻo nei mākou e aloha, [mele]

75
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:28,080
i ka wā i hoʻomaʻalili ai, i ka wā i loaʻa ai ka lehu ma nā pāma a

76
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:31,160
kristal [mele] haki. Pono wau e mālama iā ia

77
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:33,532
he aha ia, ʻoiai mākou ma ʻaneʻi, a hiki i ka wā

78
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:33,560
lele aku

79
00:03:33,532 --> 00:03:36,720
[mele]

80
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:36,720
ʻuhane i kahi mamao aku.

81
